<!--Post: 4480--><!--Time: 1106409189-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4480"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whoisbtk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whoisbtk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 22, 2005 - 7:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->When I hunt pheasants I go to Norton Ks.  I don&#39;t live there, it&#39;s just where I hunt. <BR> <BR><a href="mailto:whoisbtk@yahoo.com">whoisbtk@yahoo.com</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4480-->
<!--Post: 4485--><!--Time: 1106417263-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4485"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iceteajan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iceteajan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 22, 2005 - 10:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Whoisbtk--- <BR> <BR>Yes, but there is plenty of &#34;inventory&#34; for BTK to kill somewhere else -- he doesn&#39;t NEED to stay in Wichita to continue killing -- whereas you may only find pheasants in one general area. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
